Package: cockpit-ufw-manager
Version: 1.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: cockpit, ufw
Maintainer: George K <george-gr@yandex.ru>
Description: Cockpit plugin for managing the UFW firewall
 Adds a UFW management panel to the Cockpit web interface:
 rules, default policies, bulk delete and listening ports.
